  DRY: ipc-raw [con_mark=wm-gui-stale] kill
Restoring workspace: dev
  DRY: ipc-raw rename workspace dev to dev-old
  DRY: ipc-raw workspace --no-auto-back-and-forth dev
  DRY: write /tmp/wm-restore-dev.json
  DRY: ipc-raw append_layout /tmp/wm-restore-dev.json
  DRY: ipc-raw exec kitty -e tmux attach -t a
  DRY: sleep 600ms (let new terminals attach)
  DRY: ipc-raw [id=101] floating disable, move container to mark wm-gui-dev-2
  DRY: ipc-raw [con_mark=wm-gui-dev-2] kill
  DRY: ipc-raw workspace --no-auto-back-and-forth dev
Dry run complete
